    "tag": "v0.3.1",
    "notes": "Fixes the 0.3.0 CLI, which crashed when installed fresh with \"Cannot find module 'effect/process/CommandLine'\". @effect/platform-bun 4.0.6 asks for @effect/platform-node-shared ^4.0.6, which now resolves to 4.1.2, a version built for Effect 4.1, while the CLI pins Effect 4.0.6. The CLI now pins @effect/platform-node-shared 4.0.6 as well, and the release checks install the CLI fresh, as a user would, and run it. The libraries are unchanged from 0.3.0."
